{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Become the Master of the Wrap House!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Wrap House Simulator</strong>, step into the delicious world of sizzling skewers, and perfectly wrapped lavashes! Manage your own wrap shop with your friends, from slicing meats to perfecting sauces, all while keeping impatient customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Wrap.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2a <strong>Chop, grill, and wrap your way to success!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey starts with a small, humble shop. As you gain prestige, unlock new ingredients, decorations, and even challenge special customers like food critics and VIP guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Tomato.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Team Up or Compete in the Ultimate Wrap Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or jump into <strong>multiplayer</strong> mode where you can <strong>co-op with friends</strong> to run a smooth kitchen or challenge them to see <strong>who\u2019s the true wrap master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Fries.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Design Your Dream Wrap House, One Wrap at a Time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your restaurant with <strong>authentic &amp; modern decors</strong>, upgrades, and flashy interiors. Unlock new floors, fancy counters, and absurdly over-the-top decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533100?t=1745516189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745516189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/98c6ae3640108685d0b297fd97fae4e6e63d4efa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745516189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/98c6ae3640108685d0b297fd97fae4e6e63d4efa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745516189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3533260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Become the Master of the Wrap House!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Wrap House Simulator</strong>, step into the delicious world of sizzling skewers, and perfectly wrapped lavashes! Manage your own wrap shop with your friends, from slicing meats to perfecting sauces, all while keeping impatient customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Wrap.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2a <strong>Chop, grill, and wrap your way to success!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey starts with a small, humble shop. As you gain prestige, unlock new ingredients, decorations, and even challenge special customers like food critics and VIP guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Tomato.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Team Up or Compete in the Ultimate Wrap Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or jump into <strong>multiplayer</strong> mode where you can <strong>co-op with friends</strong> to run a smooth kitchen or challenge them to see <strong>who\u2019s the true wrap master</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Fries.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Design Your Dream Wrap House, One Wrap at a Time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your restaurant with <strong>authentic &amp; modern decors</strong>, upgrades, and flashy interiors. Unlock new floors, fancy counters, and absurdly over-the-top decorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1745516189\" /></p>","developers":["Broken Lyre Entertainment","Wendigo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533100/header.jpg?t=1745516189","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100552,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100552/movie480.mp4?t=1740096252","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100552/movie_max.mp4?t=1740096252"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100552/8b949dc3293dcf5d0a7dc787aa39dbfa8681c1ec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740096252","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100552/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740096252","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100552/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740096252"}}],"name":"Wrap House Simulator\ud83c\udf2f","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements